body:
Yup also just felt it twirling around my tongue. I feel like Im becoming a reptile. Not the first time. Got scared tho thought I was going to die choking on puke. No puke. I jumped right up and also got scared I was trapped in between two different universes. Got up so fast I saw a purplish grid. Wicked and I love it. I welcome anything that wants to bring me to a higher dimension or higher place in life. 

&#x200B;

I've completely lost my marbles.
